  },
  "note": "Election of the Coleraine Urban District Council, nominations 5 January 1923; eighteen candidates for eighteen seats, so there was no contest (Belfast Telegraph, 6 January 1923, p. 6). The summary line reads 'Coleraine—No contest'; the nomination list gives all eighteen names and adds 'There will be no contest as there have been eighteen candidates nominated for eighteen seats.' No party label was printed. Seven of the eighteen were new candidates. Returned unopposed."
